# Architecture

## Monorepo Structure

```
apps/web/              # Next.js application
├── src/app/          # App Router (file-based routing)
├── src/routers/      # tRPC routers (API layer)
├── src/server/       # Server utilities (db, trpc, auth)
└── src/shared/       # Shared code (hooks, components, lib)

packages/
├── @repo/db          # Database (Drizzle + schema)
├── @repo/ui          # UI components (Radix + Tailwind)
├── @repo/tailwind-config
└── @repo/typescript-config
```

## Dependency Rules

✅ Apps can import from packages
❌ Packages NEVER import from apps
✅ Use workspace protocol: `"@repo/db": "workspace:*"`
✅ Keep packages framework-agnostic

## Import Order

```typescript
// 1. External dependencies
import { z } from "zod";

// 2. Workspace packages
import { posts } from "@repo/db/schema";

// 3. Relative imports
import { publicProcedure } from "~/server/trpc";
```
